* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* intuition.library as tests/alertint.c and tests/crashint.c fake it, in
* the C900 dialect of exec_lib.fd: DisplayAlert, FreeSysRequest,
* EasyRequestArgs, BuildEasyRequestArgs, SysReqHandler and
* TimedDisplayAlert at intuition's vectors, each taking FakeIBase first.
* Vn is an unused intuition vector n.
